293
00:41:15,906 --> 00:41:20,786
飛べないまま
unable to fly.

294
00:41:20,786 --> 00:41:23,586
終わりたくない 想いのまま
Even so, I don't want it to end;

295
00:41:23,586 --> 00:41:28,286
想いのまま 生きていたい
I want to live true to my feelings!

296
00:41:29,496 --> 00:41:32,876
気持ちに嘘をつくようなことはやめて
Let's stop lying to our feelings,

297
00:41:32,876 --> 00:41:36,786
YES都合のいい恋は卒業しよう
and graduate from convenient love!

298
00:41:37,446 --> 00:41:43,446
そうすればきっと自分のことを好きになれるはずだよ
If we do, we're bound to love ourselves.

299
00:41:44,686 --> 00:41:47,236
強く生きていこう
Let's keep going strong!

300
00:41:54,656 --> 00:41:59,596
迷いのある人生だっていいよ
It's okay to have a wandering life,

301
00:41:59,596 --> 00:42:02,366
どんな闇だって
no matter how much darkness there is—

302
00:42:02,366 --> 00:42:06,486
超えてみせる
we'll overcome it!

303
00:42:08,396 --> 00:42:11,106
たったひとつしかない自分
With just one precious thing,

304
00:42:11,106 --> 00:42:13,766
好きになろう
let's learn to love ourselves.

305
00:42:42,879 --> 00:42:43,869
would you call me if you need my love ?
Would you call me if you need my love?

306
