with all my might, dive!

317
00:43:38,369 --> 00:43:40,019
信じる 応える その瞬間
To believe, to answer, at the moment,

318
00:43:43,319 --> 00:43:45,029
愛が僕らをひとつにする
the love makes us the one.

319
00:43:47,329 --> 00:43:48,559
time is now time is now

320
